 - it is what made the top of the ladder unreachable: at 0.24 a party of 25 met 5.8x attack while their own HP had not moved, so Woop Woop read 0-7% at EVERY headcount from 5 to 30 and Ladies of The Knight never won. Measured sweep (7 curves x 3 dungeons x 10 headcounts): 0.65 gives the top of the ladder a real turnout curve without flattening it to a guaranteed win, which 0.45 did. 0.65 per doubling is ~2.9x at forty players; do not read it as a per-head number. Re-measure with `npm run simulate:progression` section 11 after touching any of it."},"progression":{"pointsPerLevel":2,"perPoint":{"hp":2,"atk":1,"skill":1,"spd":1},"xpRate":0.25},"economy":{"recycleRate":1,"valueByRarity":{"common":20,"uncommon":45,"rare":110,"epic":260,"legendary":600},"startingGold":60},"rewards":{"mobDropChance":0.6,"casualtyXpMultiplier":0.4,"casualtyLootChance":0.15,"defeatXpMultiplier":0.15,"defeatLootChance":0.08,"compositionBonusMax":0.25}},"shop":{"gear":[{"id":"bedsheet-wraith","price":20},{"id":"crusader-helm","price":20},{"id":"rusted-bucket","price":20},{"id":"witch-s-hat","price":20},{"id":"visage-01","price":20},{"id":"visage-02","price":20},{"id":"visage-03","price":20},{"id":"visage-04","price":45},{"id":"strapped-harness","price":20},{"id":"buckled-jerkin","price":45},{"id":"chainmail-rig","price":110},{"id":"knight-s-cuirass","price":260},{"id":"worn-breeches","price":20},{"id":"sashed-trousers","price":45},{"id":"patched-leggings","price":110},{"id":"plated-greaves","price":260},{"id":"gilded-blade","price":20},{"id":"iron-shortsword","price":20},{"id":"rusty-dagger","price":20},{"id":"cleaver-greatsword","price":45},{"id":"green-draught","price":45},{"id":"pitch-torch","price":20},{"id":"storm-lantern","price":20},{"id":"coin-purse","price":110}],"consumables":[{"id":"lesser-tome-of-insight","price":70},{"id":"tome-of-insight","price":190},{"id":"greater-tome-of-insight","price":520}]},"bestiary":[{"id":"barbie","name":"BARBIEVILLE","bodies":[{"sprite":"barbies/barbie